flowchart TD
S([Start]) --> PUSH["Push symbols while reading first part"]
PUSH --> GUESS{"Nondeterministically guess midpoint"}
GUESS -->|Even length| MATCH["Read suffix and match stack top"]
GUESS -->|Odd length| SKIP["Consume one centre symbol"]
SKIP --> MATCH
MATCH --> OK{"Symbol matches top?"}
OK -->|Yes| POP["Pop and continue"]
OK -->|No| R[["Reject this branch"]]
POP --> MATCH
MATCH -->|Input exhausted and stack empty| A((Accept branch))
